{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-isa-26-1","title":"Isaiah 26:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>2:11,20; 12:1; 24:21-23; 25:9 this song. 5:1; 27:1,2; Ex 15:2-21; Nu 21:17; Jud 5:1-31; 2Sa 22:1-51 Jer 33:11; Eph 5:19,20; Re 19:1-7 in the land. Ezr 3:11; Ps 137:3,4 salvation. 60:18; 62:11; Ps 31:21; 48:12; Zec 2:5; Mt 16:18; Re 21:12-22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-26-2","title":"Isaiah 26:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>Open. 60:11; 62:10; Ps 118:20; Eze 48:31-34; Zec 8:20; Ac 2:47 Re 21:24 righteous. 60:21; Ex 19:6; De 4:6-8; Ps 106:5; 1Pe 2:9; 2Pe 3:13; Re 5:9 truth. Heb. truths. Jude 1:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-26-3","title":"Isaiah 26:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>wilt. 9:6,7; 57:19-21; Ps 85:7,8; Mic 5:5; Joh 14:27; 16:33; Ro 5:1 Eph 2:14-16; Php 4:7 in perfect peace. Heb. peace, peace. mind. or, thought, orimagination. stayed. 31:1; 48:2; 50:1 because. 1Ch 5:20; 2Ch 13:18; 16:8; Ps 9:10; Jer 17:7,8; Ro 4:18-21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-26-4","title":"Isaiah 26:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>Trust. 12:2; 50:10; 2Ch 20:20; 32:8; Ps 55:22; 62:8; Pr 3:5,6 in the. 45:17,24; 63:1; Job 9:19; Ps 46:1; 62:11; 66:7; 93:1; 125:1; Mt 6:13 Mt 28:18; Php 4:13 everlasting strength. Heb. the Rock of ages. 17:10; 32:2; De 32:4,15; 1Sa 2:2; Ps 18:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-26-5","title":"Isaiah 26:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>bringeth. 2:12; 13:11; 14:13; 25:11; Job 40:11-13 the lofty. 25:12; 32:19; 47:1; Jer 50:31,32; 51:25,26,37,64; Re 18:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-26-6","title":"Isaiah 26:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>25:10; 37:25; 60:14; Jos 10:24; Jer 50:45; Da 7:27; Zep 3:11 Mal 4:3; Lu 1:51-53; 10:19; Ro 16:20; 1Co 1:26; Jas 2:5; Re 2:26 Re 3:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-26-7","title":"Isaiah 26:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>way. 35:8; 1Ch 29:17; Job 27:5,6; Ps 18:23-26; Pr 20:7; 2Co 1:12 Eph 2:10; 1Jo 3:7,10 most. 1Sa 2:2-4; Job 31:6; *marg: Ps 1:6; 11:4,7; Zep 3:5; 1Co 4:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-26-8","title":"Isaiah 26:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>in. 64:4,5; Nu 36:13; Job 23:10-12; Ps 18:23; 44:17,18; 65:6; 106:3 Mal 4:4; Lu 1:6 we. 25:9; 30:18; 33:2; Ps 37:3-7; 63:1; Mic 7:7; Ac 1:4; Ro 8:25 2Th 3:5; Jas 5:7-11 desire. 2Sa 23:5; Ps 13:1,2; 63:1-3; 73:25; 77:10-12; 84:2; 143:5,6 So 1:2-4; 2:3-5; 5:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-26-9","title":"Isaiah 26:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>have I. Ps 63:6,7; 77:2,3; 119:62; 130:6; So 3:1-4; 5:2-8; Lu 6:12 my spirit. Ps 63:1; Pr 8:17; Mt 6:33; Mr 1:35 for. 27:9; Nu 14:21-23; Ps 58:11; 64:9; 83:18; Ho 5:15; Re 11:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-26-10","title":"Isaiah 26:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>favour. 63:9,10; Ex 8:15,31,32; 9:34; De 32:15; 1Sa 15:17; Ps 106:43 Pr 1:32; Ec 3:16; Ho 13:6; Ro 2:4,5; Re 2:21 in the. 2:10; 24:5; 27:13; Ps 78:54-58; 143:10; Jer 2:7; 31:23; Eze 22:2-16 Ho 9:3; Mic 2:10; 3:10-12; Mt 4:5 and will not. 5:12; Ps 28:4,5; Ho 11:7; Joh 5:37,38</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-26-11","title":"Isaiah 26:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>when. Ps 10:12; Mic 5:9 will. 18:3; 1Sa 6:9; Job 34:27; Jer 5:3; Ac 28:27 they shall. Ex 9:14; 1Sa 5:6-11; Jer 44:28; Lu 16:23 be. 11:13; 60:14; Ps 86:17; 1Pe 3:16; Re 3:9 at the. or, towards thy. fire. 5:24; Ps 21:8; Mal 4:1; Mt 25:41; 2Th 1:8; Re 19:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-26-12","title":"Isaiah 26:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>ordain. 57:10; Ps 29:11; Jer 33:6; Joh 14:27 for. De 30:6; Eze 36:25; Eph 2:10; Heb 13:20 in us. or, for us. Ps 57:2; Eze 20:9,14,22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-26-13","title":"Isaiah 26:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>other. 51:22; 2Ch 12:8; Joh 8:32; Ro 6:22 by thee. 12:4; Jos 23:7; Am 6:10; 1Co 4:7; Heb 13:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-26-14","title":"Isaiah 26:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>dead. 19; 8:19; 51:12,13; Ex 14:30; Ps 106:28; Hab 2:18-20; Mt 2:20 Re 18:2,3; 19:19-21; 20:5 and made. 14:19-22; Ps 9:6; 109:13; Pr 10:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-26-15","title":"Isaiah 26:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>increased. 9:3; 10:22; Ge 12:2; 13:16; Nu 23:10; De 10:22; Ne 9:23; Jer 30:19 thou art. 44:23; 60:21; Ps 86:9,10; Joh 12:23-28; 13:31,32; 15:8; 17:1 Re 11:15-18 thou hadst. 6:12; De 4:27,28; 28:25,64; 32:26,27; 1Ki 8:46; 2Ki 17:6,23 2Ki 23:27; Jer 32:37; Eze 5:12; 36:24; Lu 21:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-26-16","title":"Isaiah 26:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>in trouble. De 4:29,30; Jud 10:9,10; 2Ch 6:37,38; 33:12,13; Ps 50:15; 77:1,2 Ps 91:15; Jer 22:23; Ho 5:15; 7:14; Re 3:19 thy poured. 1Sa 1:15; Ps 42:4; 142:2; La 2:19 prayer. Heb. secret speech.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-26-17","title":"Isaiah 26:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>13:8; 21:3; Ps 48:6; Jer 4:31; 6:24; 30:6; Joh 16:21; 1Th 5:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-26-18","title":"Isaiah 26:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>we have been in. 37:3; 2Ki 19:3; Ho 13:13 we have not. Ex 5:22,23; Jos 7:7-9; 1Sa 11:13; 14:45 the inhabitants. Ps 17:14; Joh 7:7; 1Jo 5:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-26-19","title":"Isaiah 26:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>dead men. 25:8; Eze 37:1-14; Ho 6:2; 13:14; Joh 5:28,29; Ac 24:15 1Co 15:22,23; 1Th 4:14,15; Re 20:5,6,12 my dead. Mt 27:52,58; Joh 11:25,26; 1Co 15:20,23; Php 3:10,21 Awake 51:17; 52:1,2; 60:1,2; Ps 22:15; 71:20; Da 12:2; Eph 5:14 Re 11:8-11 thy dew. Ge 2:5,6; De 32:2; 33:13,28; Job 29:19; Ps 110:3; Ho 14:5; Zec 8:12 the earth. Re 20:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-26-20","title":"Isaiah 26:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>my. 51:4,16; Jer 7:23; 31:14 enter. 32:18,19; Ge 7:1,16; Ex 12:22,23; Ps 32:7; 91:4; Pr 18:10 Eze 11:16; Mt 23:37 shut. Mt 6:6 hide. Ps 17:8; 27:5; 31:20; 143:9 for a. 54:7,8; Ps 30:5; 57:1; 2Co 4:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-26-21","title":"Isaiah 26:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>Lord. 18:4; Ps 50:2,3; Eze 8:6; 9:3-6; 10:3-5,18,19; Ho 5:14,15 Mic 1:3-8; 2Th 1:7-10; Jude 1:14,15 also. Ge 4:10,11; Nu 35:32,33; Job 16:18; Eze 24:7,8; Lu 11:40 Re 6:9-11; 16:6; 18:24 blood.